          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In Fukuoka's Kurume, there lives a shy female student voice actor named Yumeha Nitahara. With her timid nature, she rarely receives work offers. Just as she is about to give up, a new transfer student, the protagonist, suddenly appears before her.\n\n\"I'm Yumeha's manager now!\"\n\nA relationship between a voice actor and her manager begins with a lie. Then, one day, a certain job opportunity comes Yumeha's way. The two, still struggling to fully grow up, repeatedly drift apart and come closer together. And eventually, this leads to love.",
